<title>CHINA: Trading in Rhine Hdgs shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Rhine Hdgs shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Rhine Holdings Ltd shares was suspended on Friday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock closed at HK$1.06 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
